  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large clay or ceramic tagine over medium-high heat.",
    "Add onion and cook, stirring occasionally, until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, turmeric, salt, and pepper. Cook, stirring constantly, for 1 minute.",
    "Add chicken and cook, stirring occasionally, until browned on all sides and cooked through, about 10 minutes.",
    "Add dried dates and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with fresh herbs, if desired."
